{"id": "18059", "title": "武松与潘金莲", "author": "金刀河", "category": "都市言情", "count": 163, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/18/18059.htm", "intro": "这是一本一直就想写的书。因为四大名著中，金刀河最喜欢的就是《水浒传》了。但原著悲剧的结尾让人遗憾。所以，我就来个狗尾续貂，写写武松在宋江等头领死后，再次哨聚水泊梁山并最终灭了高俅和大宋的故事。后来，武松做了皇帝，他本来打算杀死的嫂嫂潘金莲，因当年那句“我怀上你哥哥的骨血了”就活了下来，并最终嫁给武松，产下了一个孩子，却是西门庆的……欲知武松怎样打江山，潘金莲怎样当皇后，并怎样利用“床上功夫（本人的另一部作品）”笼络人心，请看金刀河 “糟蹋名著” 系列之一《武松与潘金莲》。", "base": "files/article/html/18/18059", "chapters": [{"title": "武松与潘金莲", "volume": true}, {"title": "第一章", "file": "1328761.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章", "file": "1328762.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章", "file": "1328765.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四章", "file": "1328766.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五章", "file": "1328768.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六章", "file": "1328769.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七章", "file": "1328771.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八章", "file": "1328772.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九章", "file": "1328774.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十章", "file": "1328777.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十一章", "file": "1328778.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十二章", "file": "1328780.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十三章", "file": "1328781.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十四章", "file": "1328784.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十五章", "file": "1328787.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十六章", "file": "1328788.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十七章", "file": "1328789.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十八章", "file": "1328791.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十九章", "file": "1328793.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十章", "file": "1328794.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十一章", "file": "1328796.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十二章", "file": "1328798.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十三章", "file": "1328799.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十四章", "file": "1328801.html"